Task 4 – Making a Chatbot

Objective

Design a simple AI-powered chatbot capable of responding instantly to user queries on a website using predefined patterns.

Features

- Instant responses to user questions
- Predefined commercial support patterns
- Retrieval-based chatbot logic
- Easy website integration
- Simple testing and optimization support

Sample Python Chatbot

responses = {
    "hello": "Hello! Welcome to our website.",
    "price": "Please contact support for pricing information.",
    "help": "I am here to assist you with your questions.",
    "bye": "Thank you for visiting. Goodbye!"
}

while True:
    user = input("You: ").lower()

    if user in responses:
        print("Bot:", responses[user])
    else:
        print("Bot: Sorry, I do not understand your request.")

    if user == "bye":
        break

